    "請在 Mac 的 Presence 打開「手機與手錶 › 允許簡報遙控」": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiviere in Presence auf dem Mac „iPhone & Watch › Präsentationssteuerung erlauben“"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Presence on your Mac, turn on iPhone & Watch › Allow Presenter Remote."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Presence en el Mac, activa “iPhone y Watch › Permitir mando de presentaciones”"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Presence sur le Mac, activez « iPhone et montre › Autoriser la télécommande de présentation »"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacのPresenceで「iPhoneとWatch › プレゼンリモコンを許可」をオンにしてください"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac의 Presence에서 ‘iPhone 및 Watch › 프레젠테이션 리모컨 허용’을 켜세요"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 Mac 上的 Presence 中打开“手机与手表 › 允许演示遥控”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在 Mac 的 Presence 打開「手機與手錶 › 允許簡報遙控」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連不上 Mac，請確認 Mac 在附近、Presence 正在執行": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac nicht erreichbar. Stelle sicher, dass er in der Nähe ist und Presence läuft"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach your Mac. Make sure it's nearby and Presence is running"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede conectar con el Mac. Comprueba que esté cerca y que Presence esté abierto"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de joindre le Mac. Vérifiez qu’il est à proximité et que Presence est ouvert"
